{"5052430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Shuttle", "steam_appid": 5052430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5135470], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LAST SHUTTLE WON'T WAIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAST SHUTTLE</strong> is an <strong>online co-op and competitive action-adventure</strong> for <strong>2 to 4 players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through dangerous ruins filled with hostile creatures, locked doors, and traps. Collect keys to unlock doors and <strong>reach the last shuttle before the opposing team</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY TOGETHER WITH 2 TO 4 PLAYERS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2- or 3-player matches, <strong>AI-controlled robots</strong> fill the open robot slots and support each team's fighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a 4-player match, two teams face off in <strong>2v2 competition</strong>. Each team consists of a fighter and a robot. Because the two roles have different abilities, victory depends on <strong>how well you work with your partner</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TWO ROLES, ONE TEAM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FIGHTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/extras/fbe62aa9e2ef408bc0fd368fd4ef38f4.poster.avif?t=1787978364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/extras/fbe62aa9e2ef408bc0fd368fd4ef38f4.webm?t=1787978364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/extras/fbe62aa9e2ef408bc0fd368fd4ef38f4.mp4?t=1787978364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate dangerous terrain, defeat enemies in <strong>close combat</strong>, and collect keys to clear a path to escape.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ROBOT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/extras/e083344583502209f8f73aed88ea76b4.poster.avif?t=1787978364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/extras/e083344583502209f8f73aed88ea76b4.webm?t=1787978364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/extras/e083344583502209f8f73aed88ea76b4.mp4?t=1787978364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay close to your partner, <strong>dash</strong> toward enemies and obstacles, <strong>knock down</strong> the opposing fighter to slow their advance, and activate your partner's <strong>shield</strong> in moments of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neither role can handle every situation alone. Combine their different abilities with <strong>precise timing</strong> to become a truly effective team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOPERATE, COMPETE, AND ESCAPE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and environmental hazards threaten everyone equally, but <strong>only one team can win</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your partner and move forward together. At the right moment, <strong>disrupt the opposing team</strong> and create an opportunity to escape first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply reaching the end is not enough. You have to <strong>get there before your opponents</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Online play</strong> for 2 to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>AI robots</strong> that fill open slots in 2- and 3-player matches </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Competition ranging from <strong>1v1 matches to role-based 2v2 team play</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Two distinct roles: <strong>the fighter and the robot</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Close-range action combat</strong> against a variety of enemies as the fighter </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Robot abilities including <strong>dashes, obstacle destruction, rival knockdowns, and partner shield activation</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Keys, checkpoints, locked doors, and a variety of traps </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>In-game voice chat</strong> with general and team channels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character skins and expressive emotes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIGHT THROUGH YOUR ENEMIES. OUTRUN YOUR RIVALS.</strong> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DON'T MISS THE LAST SHUTTLE.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LAST SHUTTLE WON'T WAIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAST SHUTTLE</strong> is an <strong>online co-op and competitive action-adventure</strong> for <strong>2 to 4 players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through dangerous ruins filled with hostile creatures, locked doors, and traps. Collect keys to unlock doors and <strong>reach the last shuttle before the opposing team</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY TOGETHER WITH 2 TO 4 PLAYERS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2- or 3-player matches, <strong>AI-controlled robots</strong> fill the open robot slots and support each team's fighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a 4-player match, two teams face off in <strong>2v2 competition</strong>. Each team consists of a fighter and a robot. Because the two roles have different abilities, victory depends on <strong>how well you work with your partner</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TWO ROLES, ONE TEAM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FIGHTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/extras/fbe62aa9e2ef408bc0fd368fd4ef38f4.poster.avif?t=1787978364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/extras/fbe62aa9e2ef408bc0fd368fd4ef38f4.webm?t=1787978364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/extras/fbe62aa9e2ef408bc0fd368fd4ef38f4.mp4?t=1787978364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate dangerous terrain, defeat enemies in <strong>close combat</strong>, and collect keys to clear a path to escape.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ROBOT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/extras/e083344583502209f8f73aed88ea76b4.poster.avif?t=1787978364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/extras/e083344583502209f8f73aed88ea76b4.webm?t=1787978364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/extras/e083344583502209f8f73aed88ea76b4.mp4?t=1787978364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay close to your partner, <strong>dash</strong> toward enemies and obstacles, <strong>knock down</strong> the opposing fighter to slow their advance, and activate your partner's <strong>shield</strong> in moments of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neither role can handle every situation alone. Combine their different abilities with <strong>precise timing</strong> to become a truly effective team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOPERATE, COMPETE, AND ESCAPE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and environmental hazards threaten everyone equally, but <strong>only one team can win</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your partner and move forward together. At the right moment, <strong>disrupt the opposing team</strong> and create an opportunity to escape first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply reaching the end is not enough. You have to <strong>get there before your opponents</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Online play</strong> for 2 to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>AI robots</strong> that fill open slots in 2- and 3-player matches </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Competition ranging from <strong>1v1 matches to role-based 2v2 team play</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Two distinct roles: <strong>the fighter and the robot</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Close-range action combat</strong> against a variety of enemies as the fighter </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Robot abilities including <strong>dashes, obstacle destruction, rival knockdowns, and partner shield activation</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Keys, checkpoints, locked doors, and a variety of traps </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>In-game voice chat</strong> with general and team channels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character skins and expressive emotes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIGHT THROUGH YOUR ENEMIES. OUTRUN YOUR RIVALS.</strong> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DON'T MISS THE LAST SHUTTLE.</strong></h2>", "short_description": "A 2-to-4-player online co-op and competitive action-adventure. Battle enemies and gather keys to navigate through perilous ruins. Outpace the opposing team to be the first to board the last shuttle!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/3b9b83ad0ab05d746b5a0314c243bfff720bb48f/header.jpg?t=1787978364", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/ec55b2e430a6a08d4d5ba8635b8c75d856efae0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787978364", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052430/ec55b2e430a6a08d4d5ba8635b8c75d856efae0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787978364", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 3 3200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 16